# 建置產物 / Build output
bin/
obj/
publish/
*.user
.vs/

# 執行期資料：資料庫與現場配方不進版控 / Runtime data: DB and live recipe are not versioned
#
# 這裡刻意「不」寫 data/ —— 在大小寫不敏感的檔案系統上（macOS APFS、Windows NTFS）
# git 會設 core.ignorecase=true，連 gitignore 比對也變成不分大小寫，
# data/ 會誤中原始碼目錄 Data/ 並把 DatabaseManager.cs 靜默排除在版控之外。
# 執行期資料庫本來就落在 bin/ 或 publish/ 底下，已被上面兩行涵蓋，
# 下面的 *.db 再兜住任何位置的資料庫檔，因此 data/ 是多餘且有害的。
# Deliberately NO `data/` rule here. On a case-insensitive file system (macOS APFS,
# Windows NTFS) git sets core.ignorecase=true, which makes gitignore matching
# case-insensitive too — so `data/` also matches the source folder `Data/` and
# silently drops DatabaseManager.cs from version control. The runtime database lands
# under bin/ or publish/, already covered above, and the *.db rule below catches the
# file wherever it ends up. `data/` was redundant and harmful.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
recipe.json

# 作業系統與編輯器產生的雜物 / OS and editor litter
#
# 開發機是 macOS、產線機是 Windows，兩邊都會在資料夾裡自動落下中繼檔。
# 不寫斜線也不加路徑，讓規則在任何層級都生效 —— 這類檔案到處都會冒出來。
# Development happens on macOS and the line runs Windows; both drop metadata files
# into folders on their own. No slash and no path, so the rules match at every level:
# this litter appears anywhere.
# Windows 的 Thumbs.db 已被上面的 *.db 涵蓋，不重複列。
# Windows' Thumbs.db is already covered by the *.db rule above; not repeated here.
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
